      "content": "it just feels like it's not even about me anymore. my mom is so tired, and my brother is always stressed because he has to deal with my stuff. i see it in their faces every day. i just feel like a huge weight that they're all stuck carrying. it's like i'm just making their lives harder by even being here.",
